{"v":4,"catch":"是時候與“Dr. TOMARI and CHIN”進行一些棘手的旋轉“射擊”了！\n行動：營救“KANA”現在開始！","desc":"《ORDYNE》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1988年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n玩家控制 TOMARI 醫生和他的助手 CHIN，從惡棍KUBOTA中救出醫生的情人 KANA。\n遊戲的關鍵是使用擊敗敵人獲得的水晶來購買強大的武器。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-10-27","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b149f90b14c524cf9c02181c4122c2eb2b0a204029344c1d258bd0f72acc6ce3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b6f5bf910058251e648fe648c2bc037cddd8c29f0b849aee4bb8c9b694684988.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e3320f3d2f938c0b71461fb314735ea545f13f321a41009df8c58bda4c9fb80c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dcfdea20480391a03f01ffaf01d5b8f22a229bcf3f9cd947cdcab11d3110ba1e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a6a258c70e5151166b172cfbafc4eb953a44c57b6d83eb7bcab4e18b8c16ad9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d5ae1fb8a0e9b4fb0faaf6237b50a65fc49cc7cf22bfa2b6d77ada21dae5ce38.jpg"],"titleId":"01004090189cc000","dlc":[]}